    "title": "Fifth Annual Main Street Madness Scheduled for October 1 in Cedar Falls - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By BVM Sportsdesk, ,\n14 hours ago The fifth annual Main Street Madness in Cedar Falls on October 1 brings excitement to Panther fans as it features UNI basketball and wrestling. This free event allows fans to engage with student-athletes and coaches ahead of the 2026-27 athletic season. Streets will be blocked off to create a vibrant sports atmosphere, with activities starting at 5:45 p.m. CT for basketball and 6:45 p.m. CT for wrestling. Read full article\n1",
